WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.506
Nearly all of it became the Sun.

00:03.206 --> 00:09.763
At the centre, gravity pulled more and more material in, until it was hot and dense enough to shine.

00:10.213 --> 00:19.271
That is the Sun, and it took almost everything: out of every thousand parts of the Solar System, nine hundred and ninety-eight are in it.
